@WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Swagger UI
# Open in browser: {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Nairobi — current + 7-day forecast with AI summary
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weather?lat=-1.2921&lon=36.8219&days=7&ai=true&units=metric&lang=en

### Current conditions only (saves AI quota)
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/current?lat=-1.2921&lon=36.8219&ai=false&units=metric

### Hourly breakdown
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/hourly?lat=-1.2921&lon=36.8219&units=metric

### Daily breakdown
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/daily?lat=-1.2921&lon=36.8219&days=7&units=metric

### Auto-detect location from caller IP
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/geo?days=1&ai=false

### Account usage / quota
GET {{WeatherAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/usage